755 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (Flip tools are the most important concept for understanding order flow. They help you identify which side of the market is in control and when that control changes. Instead of guessing the direction, flip tools confirm when buyers take control from sellers, or sellers take control from buyers. This confirmation tells you that order flow has changed.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
756 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (There are two main flip tools:)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
757 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 222 0 R
/T (1.Change in State of Delivery \(CISD\))
/E (1.Change in State of Delivery \(CISD\))
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
758 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E ( CISD happens when the market shifts from one direction to another. For example, if price was moving up \(buyers in control\) and suddenly starts closing strongly in the opposite direction, it signals that sellers may be taking control. This change confirms that the previous order flow is weakening and a new direction may begin.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
759 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 222 0 R
/T (2.Inversion )
/E (2.Inversion )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
760 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (Inversion happens when a Fair Value Gap \(FVG\) fails and price closes on the opposite side of it. This failure shows that the previous imbalance is no longer respected, and control may be shifting to the other side of the market.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
761 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (For example:)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
762 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (If there is a bullish Fair Value Gap and price comes back into it, but instead of respecting it and moving higher, price closes below the gap, that bullish FVG has failed. This failure confirms that sellers are gaining control. The bullish imbalance can now act as resistance, supporting a bearish move.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
763 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (27)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
764 0 obj
<<
